     /* Reached only after the actual XNU SCTLR enable + ISB. The identity
      * mapping preserves this physical code and the framebuffer alias.
-     * No C runtime, timer interrupt, platform driver, or filesystem starts. */
+     * No C runtime, timer interrupt, platform driver, or filesystem starts.
+     * Boot CPU only: secondaries (x21 != 0) skip the marker. */
